Gemini 4 Neon 相当牛逼\n\n我感觉在我的任务上真的可以平替 Opus 5.5 了！\n\n尤其是它的多模态能力，以及对设计和动效的还原能力相当厉害。\n\n这个视频就是他刚才给我做的几个组件，基于参考图再发散的\n\n因为它的多模态是真正的多模态，在动态内容的还原上比 Opus 5.5、比 Claude 要好很多。\n\n另外设计风格和品味也是在线的，聊天非常舒服。这么一比，GPT 真是啥也不是。\n\n谷歌现在唯一的瓶颈是 Antigravity，但最近确实优化了不少，好了很多","url":"https://x.com/op7418/status/2123269503736070603","image":{"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2123265671043928064/img/MoN4dsXxPuuehILe.jpg","width":1920,"height":1080},"published_at":"2026-11-19T12:17:52+08:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T01:18:33+08:00","lang":"zh","blogger":{"platform":"x","handle":"op7418","display_name":"歸藏(guizang.ai)","media":[{"type":"video","url":"https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2123265671043928064/vid/avc1/1920x1080/QHWQHselaNmfCHF2.mp4","preview_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2123265671043928064/img/MoN4dsXxPuuehILe.jpg","duration_ms":20266}],"quote":null,"avatar":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1636981205504786434/xDl77JIw_400x400.jpg","verified":false,"metrics":{"bookmark":169,"view":44530,"like":333,"quote":6,"reply":111,"repost":18},"comments":[{"handle":"sagivo","display_name":"Sagiv Ofek","avatar":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1905006139369992192/S_hsYJW6_400x400.jpg","text":"Did you give it the reference image and the motion spec in the same prompt, or did you feed the design first and ask it to animate after? I'm trying to figure out where it actually beats Opus on my own components and I keep getting different results depending on how I split the","published_at":"2026-11-19T12:42:41+08:00","url":"https://x.com/sagivo/status/2123275749478031857","like":0,"text_zh":"你是把参考图和运动规格放在同一个提示词里，还是先给设计、再让它去做动画？我想弄清它在我自己的组件上究竟哪里能胜过 Opus，而结果一直因我如何拆分而"},{"handle":"oreillnw","display_name":"SeanOreilly","avatar":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2123266151665041409/v-rehgWr_400x400.jpg","text":"设计品味这块同意，尤其适合边看边改。官方说 Neon 在中途纠偏上排第2，正好对上你这种流程。\n\n不过他们仍把最难的长程项目留给 Carbon，Neon 更像高频主力，不必所有任务都平替 Opus。","published_at":"2026-11-19T12:39:55+08:00","url":"https://x.com/oreillnw/status/2123275052393132068","like":0},{"handle":"yezili22","display_name":"叶籽Li","avatar":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2117814671474671616/VkvXGJLB_400x400.jpg","text":"这么好看啊！有点心动啊……","published_at":"2026-11-19T12:36:16+08:00","url":"https://x.com/yezili22/status/2123274133655949606","like":0},{"handle":"jxzsqdtg1","display_name":"Tetribe","avatar":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2118741684473446402/kBFN2sNC_400x400.jpg","text":"动效对得上参考图，这确实是谷歌的主场，省的是返工时间","published_at":"2026-11-19T12:35:13+08:00","url":"https://x.com/jxzsqdtg1/status/2123273869612192006","like":0},{"handle":"ace052000087262","display_name":"ace","avatar":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1997504248565907456/3kSiRiaF_400x400.png","text":"动效还原这块是真香啊，改两轮还稳吗","published_at":"2026-11-19T12:32:53+08:00","url":"https://x.com/ace052000087262/status/2123273282875240800","like":0},{"handle":"alphaw0ng","display_name":"Alpha","avatar":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2000831568370356224/IFygmCsO_400x400.jpg","text":"先别急着拿它全面平替 Opus 5.5。丢一张参考图，让 Gemini 4 Neon 发散几个组件，看设计和动效还原；同时盯着 Antigravity，这还是目前唯一的瓶颈，不过最近已经优化了不少。","published_at":"2026-11-19T12:30:41+08:00","url":"https://x.com/alphaw0ng/status/2123272729444884634","like":0},{"handle":"sahuaja3669","display_name":"老王实验室","avatar":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2107470619965353984/taQsgPb4_400x400.jpg","text":"做组件我还想看一关：把示例里的短文案换成长标题、空数据和报错状态，动效之外的布局还站不站得住。演示好看很加分，接上真实内容后不用返工，才真能省下开发时间。","published_at":"2026-11-19T12:28:32+08:00","url":"https://x.com/sahuaja3669/status/2123272186773528660","like":0},{"handle":"wwwyq9900488911","display_name":"luogo","avatar":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1490008810206887937/LhnMZnzC_400x400.jpg","text":"看着有点香👀","published_at":"2026-11-19T12:24:11+08:00","url":"https://x.com/wwwyq9900488911/status/2123271091972190656","like":0},{"handle":"GuangzhouY81070","display_name":"四月(siyue)","avatar":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1993978539226615809/xiVfhyVW_400x400.jpg","text":"刚用Neon测试了下， UI 层面比以前要强，速度也很快，还得深入测试","published_at":"2026-11-19T12:23:24+08:00","url":"https://x.com/GuangzhouY81070/status/2123270894483361884","like":0},{"handle":"bytecode_w","display_name":"星期六","avatar":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2108076803193769984/XsDypSOr_400x400.jpg","text":"第一版好看不算，改第二轮动效还能对上参考才算平替","published_at":"2026-11-19T12:22:35+08:00","url":"https://x.com/bytecode_w/status/2123270688001737187","like":0}]},"translated":false},{"id":"x-op7418:2123265754900607009","kind":"post","channel":null,"source_id":"x-op7418","source_name":"歸藏(guizang.ai)","title":"","summary":"谷歌新发布的 Gemini 4 Nano 相当牛逼 我感觉在我的任务上真的可以平替 Opus 5.5 了！ 尤其是它的多模态能力，以及对设计和动效的还原能力相当厉害。 这个视频就是他刚才给我做的几个组件，基于参考图再发散的 因为它的多模态是真正的多模态，在动态内容的还原上比 Opus 5.5、比 Claude 要好很多。 另外设计风格和品味也是在线的，聊天非常舒服。这么一比，GPT 真是啥也不是。…","body":"谷歌新发布的 Gemini 4 Nano 相当牛逼\n\n我感觉在我的任务上真的可以平替 Opus 5.5 了！\n\n尤其是它的多模态能力，以及对设计和动效的还原能力相当厉害。\n\n这个视频就是他刚才给我做的几个组件，基于参考图再发散的\n\n因为它的多模态是真正的多模态，在动态内容的还原上比 Opus 5.5、比 Claude 要好很多。\n\n另外设计风格和品味也是在线的，聊天非常舒服。这么一比，GPT 真是啥也不是。\n\n谷歌现在唯一的瓶颈是 Antigravity，但最近确实优化了不少，好了很多","url":"https://x.com/op7418/status/2123265754900607009","image":{"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2123265671043928064/img/MoN4dsXxPuuehILe.jpg","width":1920,"height":1080},"published_at":"2026-11-19T12:02:58+08:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T01:18:33+08:00","lang":"zh","blogger":{"platform":"x","handle":"op7418","display_name":"歸藏(guizang.ai)","media":[{"type":"video","url":"https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2123265671043928064/vid/avc1/1920x1080/QHWQHselaNmfCHF2.mp4","preview_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2123265671043928064/img/MoN4dsXxPuuehILe.jpg","duration_ms":20266}],"quote":null,"avatar":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1636981205504786434/xDl77JIw_400x400.jpg","verified":false,"metrics":{"bookmark":6,"view":2321,"like":16,"quote":0,"reply":9,"repost":0},"comments":[{"handle":"lianshangbiji","display_name":"发财姐","avatar":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_ima