单词对应的元素是哪个。 我现在真的很迷茫，因为它很不明显，你不知道哪个元素是大、哪个元素是小。 它不像 OpenAI 的行星名称和 Claude 那种文学题材的名称那么直观，不知道咋想的","body":"哇，真的太搞了！没想到谷歌真的在 Android Studio 里实装了这个元素周期表模型选择器\n\n他们这个命名真是服了。\n\n估计有很多英语国家的人也并不太清楚每个元素到底是怎么读，也不知道这个单词对应的元素是哪个。\n\n我现在真的很迷茫，因为它很不明显，你不知道哪个元素是大、哪个元素是小。\n\n它不像 OpenAI 的行星名称和 Claude 那种文学题材的名称那么直观，不知道咋想的","url":"https://x.com/op7418/status/2123262897858170911","image":{"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2123262607780143104/img/T-YJYOwjtr33yIwT.jpg","width":1584,"height":1080},"published_at":"2026-11-19T11:51:37+08:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T01:18:33+08:00","lang":"zh","blogger":{"platform":"x","handle":"op7418","display_name":"歸藏(guizang.ai)","media":[{"type":"video","url":"https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2123262607780143104/vid/avc1/1584x1080/t0S0Si7BkJMPh8mZ.mp4","preview_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2123262607780143104/img/T-YJYOwjtr33yIwT.jpg","duration_ms":11966}],"quote":null,"avatar":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1636981205504786434/xDl77JIw_400x400.jpg","verified":false,"metrics":{"bookmark":14,"view":18626,"like":52,"quote":4,"reply":42,"repost":1},"comments":[{"handle":"jazz_builds","display_name":"Jazz","avatar":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1516282381551869953/kZbAHfAZ_400x400.jpg","text":"本来选模型就要先查一下哪个快哪个强\n现在还得先回忆高中化学\n我这种新手大概会一直用默认那个","published_at":"2026-11-19T12:13:56+08:00","url":"https://x.com/jazz_builds/status/2123268510625218762","like":0},{"handle":"jxzsqdtg1","display_name":"Tetribe","avatar":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2118741684473446402/kBFN2sNC_400x400.jpg","text":"以后调个模型还得先查原子序数，写代码跟配试剂似的","published_at":"2026-11-19T12:12:41+08:00","url":"https://x.com/jxzsqdtg1/status/2123268197348724853","like":0},{"handle":"poerpo5","display_name":"报纸","avatar":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1897902939039219712/XnEqEFaI_400x400.jpg","text":"他就是不想让你知道哪个更好，避免未发布时被人预判模型能力梯度哈哈哈","published_at":"2026-11-19T12:02:25+08:00","url":"https://x.com/poerpo5/status/2123265616081735800","like":