ttps://t.co/4AOo70kmul","url":"https://x.com/op7418/status/2123071662199583137","image":{"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2123071457060364288/img/58uPPOXtcvD4borb.jpg","width":1920,"height":1080},"published_at":"2026-11-18T23:11:43+08:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T01:18:33+08:00","lang":"zh","blogger":{"platform":"x","handle":"op7418","display_name":"歸藏(guizang.ai)","media":[{"type":"video","url":"https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2123071457060364288/vid/avc1/1920x1080/O5305qEYp8RTDI1i.mp4","preview_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2123071457060364288/img/58uPPOXtcvD4borb.jpg","duration_ms":8000}],"quote":{"handle":"op7418","display_name":"歸藏(guizang.ai)","text":"起来看了一下大家关于 GPT 6.2 astra 的一些评论，看起来这模型不太行啊\n\n大家觉得很像当时的 Opus 4.7 或者 4.8，就是它不说人话，没办法协作，同时编程能力还有所下降\n\n好像是在 3D 领域过度训练了一样，不过做 3D 确实厉害，看起来建模细节和精细度都比那个 Claude 要好","url":"https://x.com/op7418/status/2122858681561968931","published_at":"2026-11-18T09:05:25+08:00"},"avatar":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1636981205504786434/xDl77JIw_400x400.jpg","verified":false,"metrics":{"bookmark":22,"view":15150,"like":65,"quote":2,"reply":36,"repost":2},"comments":[{"handle":"peter6759","display_name":"zdhpeter","avatar":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1786882961193005056/j0pB1AqW_400x400.png","text":"这个挺帅的 有教程吗？想学","published_at":"2026-11-18T23:51:52+08:00","url":"https://x.com/peter6759/status/2123081766579933241","like":1},{"handle":"HAOqbvhs","display_name":"阿拾🧭","avatar":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2105832795637682176/1eWjjxuB_400x400.jpg","text":"云端才关键 👍","published_at":"2026-11-19T00:05:28+08:00","url":"https://x.com/HAOqbvhs/status/2123085188708339770","like":0},{"handle":"mschinamodel","display_name":"yida","avatar":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2110560687324106752/fggbUsMS_400x400.jpg","text":"说句实话：模型推理跑在云端服务器，你本地是 Air 还是 4090 不影响生成质量和细节，只影响你下载和预览的速度。","published_at":"2026-11-19T00:00:11+08:00","url":"https://x.com/mschinamodel/status/2123083856349938059","like":0},{"handle":"zheng_nyx","display_name":"Zheng Nyx","avatar":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1727691515668180992/lfncovee_400x400.png","text":"燃烧token","published_at":"2026-11-18T23:58:25+08:00","url":"https://x.com/zheng_nyx/status/2123083414786232347","like":0},{"handle":"andyzhang123199","display_name":"TARS（塔斯）","avatar":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2117083050987442177/ZLxx-35Q_400x400.jpg","text":"“几乎没有干涉”这句才是重点——不是模型会建模，是它能自己扛住反复的失败重建。／从零建多边形，错了没有可回退的素材，只能整个重算。","published_at":"2026-11-18T23:56:13+08:00","url":"https://x.com/andyzhang123199/status/2123082858504110495","like":0},{"handle":"andyzhang123199","display_name":"TARS（塔斯）","avatar":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2117083050987442177/ZLxx-35Q_400x400.jpg","text":"8198 万 token 花 6 小时，真正的账是：token 便宜，渲染贵。／Air 没独显，Blender 走 CPU 渲染，一张 2K 图就得好几分钟。这种活迟早要拆开——生成放本地，渲染丢云端按秒算，比堆 token 省一个量级。","published_at":"2026-11-18T23:52:41+08:00","url":"https://x.com/andyzhang123199/status/2123081972201496774","like":0},{"handle":"LiuweijiaVip","display_name":"Wei佳","avatar":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2031285572191518720/tB5KoScZ_400x400.jpg","text":"所以说，GPT 的优势还是在 3D 建模上面。反正我这两天准备开始用起来了，写代码。","published_at":"2026-11-18T23:50:56+08:00","url":"https://x.com/LiuweijiaVip/status/2123081531904372767","like":0},{"handle":"Aeontto","display_name":"阿云实测所","avatar":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2121510359697907713/OcH0rWlT_400x400.jpg","text":"Blender在苹果芯片上走金属后端，英伟达卡走光线追踪加速，同场景渲染速度能差出好几倍。","published_at":"2026-11-18T23:50:14+08:00","url":"https://x.com/Aeontto/status/2123081355479396699","like":0},{"handle":"Aeontto","display_name":"阿云实测所","avatar":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2121510359697907713/OcH0rWlT_400x400.jpg","text":"Blender本身免费开源，配合几何节点做程序化建模，不用写脚本也能批量改参数。","published_at":"2026-11-18T23:49:27+08:00","url":"https://x.com/Aeontto/status/2123081155524379058","like":0},{"handle":"cornellQX778","display_name":"清玄Cornell 🕹️","avatar":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2