://x.com/op7418/status/2122925281514303836","image":{"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HXYlDMDbcAEWQjs.jpg","width":2472,"height":2216},"published_at":"2026-11-18T13:30:03+08:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T16:12:56+08:00","lang":"zh","blogger":{"platform":"x","handle":"op7418","display_name":"歸藏(guizang.ai)","media":[{"type":"image","url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HXYlDMDbcAEWQjs.jpg"}],"quote":{"handle":"op7418","display_name":"歸藏(guizang.ai)","text":"GPT-6.2 Astra 虽然大家的反馈都不太好\n\n但我感觉 Sol 是真的快，快了太多了！\n\n开了 Fast 以后，任务完成得相当迅速。所以我觉得 6.2 Sol 还是挺不错的。\n\n我现在试试这个 6.2 Sol Ultra Fast 有多快，让他剪个视频试试","url":"https://x.com/op7418/status/2122903729578070252","published_at":"2026-11-18T12:04:25+08:00"},"avatar":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1636981205504786434/xDl77JIw_400x400.jpg","verified":false,"metrics":{"bookmark":9,"view":21281,"like":34,"quote":2,"reply":59,"repost":2},"comments":[{"handle":"dyisan1","display_name":"dyisan","avatar":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1426367965478342658/f9Oh5aVq_400x400.jpg","text":"平均126 token/s、峰值252，听着很快。但按你自己的测试，剪一条8分钟视频，模型响应约14分钟，全流程还是花了27分钟。速度指标和活干完不是一回事。","published_at":"2026-11-18T16:56:56+08:00","url":"https://x.com/dyisan1/status/2122977344755306636","like":1},{"handle":"jxzsqdtg1","display_name":"Tetribe","avatar":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2118741684473446402/kBFN2sNC_400x400.jpg","text":"平均一百二最高两百五，剪视频后处理又耗了十三分钟","published_at":"2026-11-18T23:18:51+08:00","url":"https://x.com/jxzsqdtg1/status/2123073455444918779","like":0},{"handle":"ayanmakes","display_name":"阿彦不想返工","avatar":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2115092716011102208/LN3IrJl-_400x400.jpg","text":"我觉得可以再看，快的同时切点和节奏还稳不稳。速度过了，成片还得经得住看。","published_at":"2026-11-18T23:05:24+08:00","url":"https://x.com/ayanmakes/status/2123070071010721807","like":0},{"handle":"Worldwide2060","display_name":"Aivatar","avatar":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2120040347149709312/0teU2Odi_400x400.jpg","text":"126 token/s 平均、最快 252，这个速度配上 Sol 的定价就很有意思了。\n输入 